{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and sounds required during the production process were created with the help of AI tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final result was carefully reviewed and re-edited before use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please take this into consideration before purchasing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The repeated curse of Amalian. <br>Will I be able to survive in the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Former photojournalist Ryan carries a certain trauma from the city </i><br> <br> <br><i>and arrives at the remote southern island of \u201cGreenwood Island.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just as he begins to adapt to the peaceful everyday life, </i><br> <br> <br><i>cracks begin to appear in the once calm Greenwood Island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The dust-covered lens of his camera begins to shine toward the island\u2019s truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/51e358cbb8717be0bb9a64946489f49c.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/93fee7096893378234d38dfa25d05b04.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1240 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/353fd52b5b6df563d59cd0cccde363d4.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/91950ca9254a7f62c43f920ee184eb9a.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/d429c4c770db19e7b0530c5958257630.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the climax of the prayer during the \u201cHoly Night\u201d ritual, rain falls without exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone on the island is hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the enchanting scenery lies a layered, dark truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/560da387e3c50518f0a968d18151cdba.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1240 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/6a34a2fdf5c7da824339d5f6279df476.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1240 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/2af1d6e7e61b5d4c5e301a9a4c67d41f.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1240 height=694 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deduction Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth will not be revealed all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross through routes and puzzles to uncover the faith of Amalian and the secrets of Greenwood Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/b675ad329b4febb967328ed0cf920aa1.poster.avif?t=1769061953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/b675ad329b4febb967328ed0cf920aa1.webm?t=1769061953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/b675ad329b4febb967328ed0cf920aa1.mp4?t=1769061953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/4a02042577dfe064d1e4c7f41378be3b.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1240 height=694 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Choices</strong> <br>Choices branch into various types: gaining affinity, discovering hints, establishing values, or even death. <br>Some choices may directly lead to death. Careful decision-making is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/d35d903b211821e24a9c99ffe26425b9.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1240 height=692 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Interactions, Exploration</strong> <br>Explore locations, interact with the environment, obtain hints, and discover items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/c982d80f9d44bdccbea6559546d1e616.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Item Usage</strong> <br>Items can be acquired automatically as the scenario progresses or through exploration. <br>Use the right item to break through critical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/1ae37b3fa0a7aa498412e145d286189b.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Escape Room Puzzles</strong> <br>Solve puzzles to enter locked doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/ac3a29cb1737ec85a3e4b59ca54c6363.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1280 height=724 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-route &amp; Multi-ending by Values</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your values, the story branches into multiple paths, <br>allowing you to experience many different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Ryan and pursue the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/c1a43b079e04417642f2250e5cca3bf1.avif?t=1769061953\" width=1240 height=698 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790450?t=1769061953","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790450?t=1769061953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/e3aa9e78fb3c11939a2c95ea78d43d1622d48f02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769061953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/e3aa9e78fb3c11939a2c95ea78d43d1622